  "text": "AFK Kalphite Queen\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\nStand next to Kalphite Queen on her western or southern side so as not to aggro guardians.\n​\nNecromancy AFK Method (59+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMandatory AFK Requirements\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nTalent Tree Unlocks\n⬥ Tiers 1-2\n    • Conjure / Command Skeleton Warrior  \n⬥ Tiers 3-4\n    • Conjure Putrid Zombie  \n⬥ Tier 7\n    • Conjure Undead Army  Customised to conjure Skeleton and zombie\nItems\n⬥ Weapon Poison +++ \n⬥  Cinderbane gloves \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \n⬥ Scripture of Wen  or Scripture of Ful \n⬥ Sorrow  or Ruination \n⬥ Penance aura \n⬥ Holy Scarab  for prayer sustain\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ Note: This is by no means a minimum set-up.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n​\n⬥ Necromancy preset \n​\n​\n\nAction Bar \n\n​\nExample Kills \n⬥ Necro example\n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Kalphite Queen ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning Stand next to Kalphite Queen on her western or southern side so as not to aggro guardians. ​ Necromancy AFK Method (59+ kph) Overview Mandatory AFK Requirements ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Talent Tree Unlocks ⬥ Tiers 1-2 • Conjure / Command Skeleton Warrior ⬥ Tiers 3-4 • Conjure Putrid Zombie ⬥ Tier 7 • Conjure Undead Army Customised to conjure Skeleton and zombie Items ⬥ Weapon Poison +++ ⬥ Cinderbane gloves ⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor or Igneous Kal-Zuk ⬥ Scripture of Wen or Scripture of Ful ⬥ Sorrow or Ruination ⬥ Penance aura ⬥ Holy Scarab for prayer sustain ⬥ Note: This is by no means a minimum set-up. ​ Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Necromancy preset ​ ​ Action Bar ​ Example Kills ⬥ Necro example ​",
